                        "entry_id": "f1dfdda0-b668-378a-add8-0d2bdee1ad26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An introduction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0854bf53-fef4-3e28-954b-44fde24dc8ca",
                        "entry_id": "f1dfdda0-b668-378a-add8-0d2bdee1ad26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The opening sequence at beginning of a film, television program, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69a84187-6a75-3a72-8c6c-113880f2963c",
                        "entry_id": "f1dfdda0-b668-378a-add8-0d2bdee1ad26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small demo produced to promote one's demogroup or for a competition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cde1cd7a-ca91-4e92-a4ff-13b5f3cf4f98",
                                "sense_id": "69a84187-6a75-3a72-8c6c-113880f2963c",
                                "text": "If the rules specify that the DLLs' size will be added to the 64K limit, there's not a lot of space to code an intro."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d2d8404-c79d-499a-b8f5-0ff64390b0c1",
                                "sense_id": "69a84187-6a75-3a72-8c6c-113880f2963c",
                                "text": "Are there any sites that have original copies of games? (ie: Summer/Winter/World Games with Fast Loading). Just looking for games without the trainers/intros."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b157e0b-5f37-47ba-b5eb-7aa911a1fa6d",
                                "sense_id": "69a84187-6a75-3a72-8c6c-113880f2963c",
                                "text": "Games, demos, intros. They were the same, this was the scene. The trend was that you cracked and made demos and intros."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
